# The Gardens' two mana abilities. "{T}: Add {C}" pays Sol Ring's {1} with nothing left over. "{1}, {T}: Add one mana of
# any color" (CR 605.1a): Mox Jet's B pays the {1} exactly, the Gardens adds R and the pool is exactly {R} right after (one
# mana less would not activate, one more would show), which Lightning Bolt then spends on Bot2.

[Bot1 Deck]
The Mycosynth Gardens
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Lightning Bolt
Island x3
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.The Mycosynth Gardens.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
